	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0302_oldman1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さみしいときでも　ポケモンの
つぶらな　ひとみを　みてりゃ▽
かなしい　きもちも　とけていくよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:19:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:16:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>寂しいときでも　ポケモンの
つぶらな　ひとみを　みてりゃ▽
哀しい　気持ちも　溶けていくよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:19:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
